claim = "In the dispatcher loop, VerifyLevel::Bool(false) is the single skip-without-skill arm. It increments stats.skipped_doc_only and invokes no skill, and the inline intent_stmt anchors this arm as the same skip semantic used by opt-out intents (verify=false)."
